---
// FTC-compliant affiliate disclosure box
---

<aside
    class="affiliate-disclosure"
    role="note"
    aria-label="Affiliate Disclosure"
>
  <div class="disclosure-header">
    <svg class="disclosure-icon" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4m0-4h.01"/></svg>
    <strong>Disclosure</strong>
  </div>
  <p>
    Some links on this page are affiliate links, which means we may earn a
    commission if you make a purchase. This comes at no additional cost to you
    and helps us keep FloatJet running. We only recommend tools we've personally
    tested or genuinely believe will help you work more efficiently.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .affiliate-disclosure {
    background: var(--color-sun);
    border: 2px solid var(--color-ink);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    box-shadow: 5px 6px 0 0 var(--color-ink);
    transform: rotate(-0.5deg);
  }

  .disclosure-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .disclosure-icon {
    width: 1.25rem;
    height: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .affiliate-disclosure p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .affiliate-disclosure {
      padding: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
